            "text": "Replace the content of an existing artefact, addressed by id. The new content is validated against the artefact's type schema. Editing the latest row of a status type changes the report's canonical status (latest-wins); to re-assess while keeping history, append a new artefact instead. Attribution is creation-time only — edits don't reassign it.",
